    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Leguiumz Experience, the official game of the Leguiumz twitch channel!<br><br>Embark on several game modes, to interact directly with the stream, and obtain many advantages!<br>Compete against other viewers of the channel in an endless battle, for glory, and priority on your requests!<br>Several game modes, to make the stream even crazier than before!<br><br>The first game mode available in Leguiumz Experience will be: <strong>The Room</strong>.<br><br>- You are directly immersed in FPS type immersion in Leguiumz's room, except for one detail, you are the size of a mouse!<br>- Several bonuses are available on the map.<br>- Reappear endlessly, and achieve victory by pressing the giant Leguiumz keyboard.<br>- Each channel points event on Twitch will have a direct interaction with the map, it's up to you to discover all of them!<br><br>Other game modes are currently in development.",
